{
  "title": "Mediterranean Chickpea and Greek Yogurt Power Bowl",
  "description": "This Mediterranean Chickpea and Greek Yogurt Power Bowl delivers 22g of protein in just 25 minutes. It combines fiber-rich chickpeas with creamy yogurt and fresh vegetables for a satisfying meat-free meal.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
  "category": "Lunch",
  "servings": 4,
